<title>USA: Viacom Inc board member resigns.</title>
<headline>Viacom Inc board member resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viacom Inc said on Friday that George Johnson, president and chief executive of Extended Stay America Inc, has resigned from its board of directors.</p>
<p>Johnson said in a statement that he is leaving the board because his duties at Extended Stay and other business activities make it difficult for him to devote enough time to the Viacom board.</p>
<p>He has been a member of Viacom's board since 1994 after the merger of Viacom and Blockbuster Entertainment.</p>
</text>
